    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>1. 背景信息 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span>1.1. 缘起 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>1.2. 为什么选择播客的形式 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>1.3. 创作过程 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>1.4. 译本的选择 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>1.5. 风险提示 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a></span></p><span></span><h2><span>2. 在「极端斯坦」里越过越好 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a></span></h2><span></span><h2><span>3. 引出「反脆弱」的概念 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span>3.1. 什么是反脆弱的状态 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>3.2. 反脆弱的一些特征 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>3.3. 反脆弱的方法论意义 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a></span></p><span></span><h2><span>4. 我们让自己变得更脆弱 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">15:53</a></span></h2><span></span><h2><span>5. 「反脆弱」是「黑天鹅」的解药 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a></span></h2><span></span><h2><span>6. 关于这本书的一些说明 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1377">22:57</a></span></h2><span></span><h2><span>7. 结束 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a></span></h2><span></span><p><span>飞书文档逐字稿：</span><a href="https://xui53w4y2h.feishu.cn/docx/Us0yd0imnolw41xHh1HcJSYgn2b?from=from_copylink" data-url="https://xui53w4y2h.feishu.cn/docx/Us0yd0imnolw41xHh1HcJSYgn2b?from=from_copylink"><span>跳转链接</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>PS：本来打算把逐字稿发在公众号上，但是思前想后，还是用飞书文档吧，欢迎大家在小宇宙或者飞书文档上进行互动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>后续说明：在阅读完第一卷后，我评估了一下展现的形式，似乎还是文字更适合一些。因此，反脆弱的后续笔记将发布在小报童（底稿）及公众号（成文）上。播客形式的笔记终止。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小报童：<a data-url="https://xiaobot.net/p/yestoday" href="https://xiaobot.net/p/yestoday">xiaobot.net</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：Yestoday</span></p>]]></description>
