    <guid isPermaLink="false">631efb2a90e867995c09381c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Sep 2022 09:26:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 《脱口秀大会 5》的心理阴影及解决办法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 「脱口秀大会」之于「脱口秀」 V.S. 「在机构做投资」之于「投资」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 投资上认识的新朋友们</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 杭州地铁颜色分布</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a> 麦当劳买咖啡的 bug</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a> 「丁克」还是「childfree」？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 无解的人口问题</span></p><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><p><strong><span>1. 摆脱《脱口秀大会 S5》的阴影</span></strong></p><p><span>毛冬 基本无害《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631e07b666d1de6e4ff8f640" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631e07b666d1de6e4ff8f640"><span>Ep78 胡豆豆：渴望通勤的保险柜男孩</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>Ponge《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/swfq_4Dn5CdVJEcKwtm71A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/swfq_4Dn5CdVJEcKwtm71A"><span>李诞脱口秀工作手册读后感</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>Storm 伐要去管它《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631dfd1cea54bb09f77f29c6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631dfd1cea54bb09f77f29c6"><span>【脱口秀大会】能不能四年办一次</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>Ricky Gervais《</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1u34y177eF" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1u34y177eF"><span>SuperNature-超自然</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>Ricky Gervais《</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wS4y1Q7qc" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wS4y1Q7qc"><span>Humanity-人性</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><strong><span>2. Play you own game</span></strong></p><p><span>Ponge 《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9Inda25l2rtnz5o4xqgX6w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9Inda25l2rtnz5o4xqgX6w"><span>Yestoday Newsletter No.010</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><strong><span>3. 新朋友</span></strong></p><p><span>我有病你有药么《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2pljxiR5u5jX55KScBQUNw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2pljxiR5u5jX55KScBQUNw"><span>随想和瞎想</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>其他一些不太大众但我都标了星标的投资相关公众号（没给钱，排名不分先后）：</span></p><p><span>睿璞投资《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gaY0OFAbE0bDtGDPUpurVA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gaY0OFAbE0bDtGDPUpurVA"><span>2021年睿璞投资致投资者的一封信</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>他山之石观投资《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AlbrS4MuX5CYc-2zQ27kCg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AlbrS4MuX5CYc-2zQ27kCg"><span>传奇价值投资人Chuck Akre及其三脚凳理论</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>芒格书院《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mhDY5eg7b8509n1Zm1PLJQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mhDY5eg7b8509n1Zm1PLJQ"><span>北大光华价值投资案例｜中通快递，投资价值几何？</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>价投弓长张《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EyFK2MxiQYfAiigGoL-QFQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EyFK2MxiQYfAiigGoL-QFQ"><span>投资中的“长坡厚雪，安全边际”</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>李可《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzIwNDI4OTM3Nw==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2485018350486634496&amp;from_itemidx=1&amp;from_msgid=2247487301#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MzIwNDI4OTM3Nw==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2485018350486634496&amp;from_itemidx=1&amp;from_msgid=2247487301#wechat_redirect"><span>从财报看特斯拉</span></a><span>》付费系列文章</span></p><p><span>CxEric《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7VqDey7XQJISQGfkyn8iyQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7VqDey7XQJISQGfkyn8iyQ"><span>费雪作品目录与阅读建议</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>吴镇宇《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Iq0mefTWMKkv4kW8DwKOTQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Iq0mefTWMKkv4kW8DwKOTQ"><span>你可以从奥马哈先知沃伦·巴菲特身上学到什么</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>闫海进《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Dy23ypfiykR7v8jS_1bhsw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Dy23ypfiykR7v8jS_1bhsw"><span>类比是投资决策中最简单的误区</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>彼得张《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G_amJclHeO1KY7AbHvf7fQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/G_amJclHeO1KY7AbHvf7fQ"><span>重读“人类误判心理学”</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>许哲《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/w-B4-iust1-znigaL2lJSQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/w-B4-iust1-znigaL2lJSQ"><span>【塔山之石】塔勒布比特币黑皮书</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>刘强《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9qVit_K7V8BAkicKXVWauA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9qVit_K7V8BAkicKXVWauA"><span>重提价值投资：深度价值投资者的圣杯</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>章圣冶《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0jaEdNJG0dDuNbi0qYjn2Q" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0jaEdNJG0dDuNbi0qYjn2Q"><span>一条很有价值的「定律」</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>郭瑜《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hsACA9soWjdRYX17pwd_zQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hsACA9soWjdRYX17pwd_zQ"><span>怎样的研究报告不会被扔垃圾桶？</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><strong><span>4. 杂事</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c9nXhLb4525S28ptZvGGVg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c9nXhLb4525S28ptZvGGVg"><span>杭州地铁的“七色彩虹”成员，你能认全吗？</span></a></p><p><span>高玉春《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NhEgtZTTocFyF81etPH8Lg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NhEgtZTTocFyF81etPH8Lg"><span>社会化视角下的丁克现象</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>东亚观察局《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6310ee7e43274df80456cd7d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6310ee7e43274df80456cd7d"><span>109 高龄少子眼看完蛋 就是不生你说咋办</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>新·井户端会议《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631247f543274df80456cdfc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/631247f543274df80456cdfc"><span>【梵高Mone¥Talk】听完日韩人口现状 算算咱自己的经济账</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>X 博士《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/66_vPaOET2qNw8bsrkjCuA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/66_vPaOET2qNw8bsrkjCuA"><span>韩国人已经生不出小孩了</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>Ponge 《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oIW0WgvzDgts_2W2BCMseQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oIW0WgvzDgts_2W2BCMseQ"><span>Yestoday Newsletter No.006</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>Ponge 《</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KumKCOdydp34CZzR-hEtXQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KumKCOdydp34CZzR-hEtXQ"><span>&lt;关于我国人口转型的认识和应对之策&gt;笔记</span></a><span>》</span></p>]]></description>
