    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>时间轴：</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 聊威哥和阎鹤祥的访谈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a> 刻意练习基本功、频繁反馈的重要性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 定义的泛化，比如脱口秀、黑天鹅、上帝、价值投资</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a> 顺便聊聊价值投资的问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 一个好玩的 AI 画图小工具</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 衍生问题 1：图片版权被颠覆了吗？AIGC 会出现吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a> 衍生问题 2：AI 会有意识吗？AI 会自我反抗吗？</span></p><h2><span>参考资料：</span></h2><p><span>1. 威哥和阎鹤祥的访谈</span></p><p><span>西四五条《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6302ad5372dc8cbf855b68a7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6302ad5372dc8cbf855b68a7"><span>Vol.83 访谈|威哥：相声要支棱起来，该向脱口秀学什么？</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>故事 FM《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5f96a54e83c34e85dd0253b7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5f96a54e83c34e85dd0253b7"><span>E425. 德云社阎鹤祥：上次节目播出后，我第一次去现场听了脱口秀</span></a><span>》</span></p><p><span>2. 我整理的黑天鹅的定义</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtedR7KpUuVnPb3kPjihgFqlQAOA.png"></figure><p><span>3. 抽象的上帝：</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E9%9B%85%E5%A8%81/4394508" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E9%9B%85%E5%A8%81/4394508"><span>雅威_百度百科</span></a></p><p><span>4. 和菜头的这篇文章带我入坑 AI 作图：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/i3W7EeHNRbbPUASoyzXU3g" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/i3W7EeHNRbbPUASoyzXU3g"><span>今天，是我画的题图</span></a></p><p><span>5. 百度 AI 画图：</span><a href="https://yige.baidu.com/#/" data-url="https://yige.baidu.com/#/"><span>文心·一格 - AI艺术和创意辅助平台</span></a></p><p><span>6. 我的一些 AI 画作：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqmoi8R45fq2fKWERMLI-T_93_S0.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgHitNanEIrn8_1H1AcHFOYlNxAG.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYCIwfc-nlToWZjOh9us5iaOOBs.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjiP24jK1wvJCWdWudXmTRmIZV3y.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrUgObvN7sE63d1Dba2j7VSI7inc.png"></figure><p><span>7. 波士顿动力（Boston Dynamics）的一些视频：</span></p><p><span>机器人跑酷：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Zy4y1V7oT" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Zy4y1V7oT"><span>Partners in Parkour</span></a></p><p><span>机器人跳舞：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ko4y1Z7ee" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ko4y1Z7ee"><span>Happy New Year</span></a></p><p><span>8. 齐马蓝（Zima Blue）：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FV411o71i" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FV411o71i"><span>哔哩哔哩</span></a></p><p><span>9. 《用几何直觉理解欧拉公式》：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bF411P7RL" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bF411P7RL"><span>哔哩哔哩</span></a></p>]]></description>
